iggers a WARNING.","props":{"page":1}},{"id":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/chunk/MC-2026-01-s1","cls":"Chunk","label":"MC-2026-01 §1. Scope","description":null,"text":"1. Scope. The service provider performs the predictive maintenance actions MAINT-01 and MAINT-02 on ST04_PACKAGING and ST02_SEALING, as defined in SOP-003.","props":{"page":1}},{"id":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/rule/RULE-ST02-04","cls":"Rule","label":"RULE-ST02-04","description":"CUR drift at ST02_SEALING CORRELATES with speed reduction at ST04_PACKAGING","text":null,"props":{"critHi":15.0,"unit":"A","warnLo":11.0,"action":"Monitor ST04_PACKAGING-SPD whenever ST02_SEALING-CUR triggers WARNING","warnHi":13.5,"ruleClass":"OperationalRule","severity":"WARNING","sensorType":"CUR","critLo":9.5}}],"decisions":[{"edge_id":"da8c08ce55e6","verdict":"follow","reason":"Mentions TMP-2210 sensor model"},{"edge_id":"34b63c1cf963","verdict":"follow","reason":"Temperature sensor monitors station"},{"edge_id":"76b1a8f75577","verdict":"follow","reason":"Links sensor to model TMP-2210"},{"edge_id":"0ec0a7076170","verdict":"prune","reason":"Current sensor, not temperature"},{"edge_id":"29364dd15c6f","verdict":"follow","reason":"TMP thresholds chunk for sensor"},{"edge_id":"76a337cd30f1","verdict":"follow","reason":"TMP thresholds chunk for station"},{"edge_id":"a9ebe370ef7f","verdict":"prune","reason":"Pressure sensor, not temperature"},{"edge_id":"08e2f387fc57","verdict":"follow","reason":"Mentions datasheet DS-THERM-2200 and 200°C limit"},{"edge_id":"b23abc6d2335","verdict":"prune","reason":"Current thresholds, not temperature"},{"edge_id":"61c977fe74b3","verdict":"prune","reason":"Pressure thresholds, not temperature"},{"edge_id":"b23e10c11ecd","verdict":"follow","reason":"Critical temp rule applies to sensor"},{"edge_id":"9da56bade211","verdict":"prune","reason":"Pressure sensor model"},{"edge_id":"6fd77f7038d9","verdict":"prune","reason":"Pressure thresholds"},{"edge_id":"706b9b8e45df","verdict":"prune",