{"run_id":"demo-contradiction","seq":10,"ts":"2026-10-24T09:50:02Z","type":"beat","payload":{"act":"answer","focus":["https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/chunk/SOP-001-s3","https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/chunk/SOP-002-s4","https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/chunk/SQA-THERMO-001-s2","https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/rule/RULE-ST02-02","https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/rule/RULE-THR-ST02-TMP-CRIT","https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/sensor/ST02_SEALING_TMP","https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/sensormodel/TMP-2210","https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/station/ST02_SEALING"],"caption":"Answer, backed by 13 citations. 1 contradiction between sources, shown instead of hidden.","emphasis":"contradiction","step":null}}
{"run_id":"demo-contradiction","seq":11,"ts":"2026-10-24T09:50:02Z","type":"answer","payload":{"text":"The critical temperature limit (CRIT_HI) at ST02_SEALING is 210°C, above which an emergency stop is triggered for ST02, ST03, and ST04. The installed TMP-2210 sensor is rated for continuous operation only up to 200°C, so the datasheet does not support running up to the 210°C critical limit, as this exceeds the sensor's continuous rating by 10°C and voids the warranty for drift caused by thermocouple ageing.","justification":"RULE-ST02-02 and RULE-THR-ST02-TMP-CRIT define the critical high threshold at 210°C and apply to ST02_SEALING_TMP and ST02_SEALING, as detailed in SOP-001 §2.2 and SOP-002 §ST02_SEALING TMP thresholds. The sensor model TMP-2210 is identified via edge [76b1a8f75577] (ST02_SEALING_TMP — of_model — TMP-2210). SQA-THERMO-001 §2 (Warranty Conditions) and the TMP-2210 note state the sensor is rated for 200°C continuous operation, with operation above 200°C voiding the warranty.","citations":[{"edge_id":null,"chunk_id":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/chunk/SOP-001-s3"},{"edge_id":null,"chunk_id":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/chunk/SOP-002-s4"},{"edge_id":"76b1a8f75577","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":null,"chunk_id":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/chunk/SQA-THERMO-001-s2"},{"edge_id":"b23e10c11ecd","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"f1e78defa0d6","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"79e2a13dac58","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"29dcfd3b3f64","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"29364dd15c6f","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"76a337cd30f1","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"17e3630fa007","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"34b63c1cf963","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"08e2f387fc57","chunk_id":null}],"contradictions":[{"a":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/chunk/SOP-001-s3","b":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/chunk/SQA-THERMO-001-s2","note":"SOP-001 §2.2 and SOP-002 §ST02_SEALING TMP thresholds set the critical temperature limit (CRIT_HI) at 210°C for ST02_SEALING, but SQA-THERMO-001 §2 states the TMP-2210 sensor warranty covers continuous operation only up to 200°C. The 210°C critical limit exceeds the sensor's 200°C continuous rating by 10°C."}],"canary":null}}
